From: XNU 26 Rebase <rebase@local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:12:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ios26: EL0 PAC locore fast-path, pre-launchd overlay, cool
 Kryo 485 OPPs, SPMI touch lock, backlight/wifi/video

---
